er colleague and friend. Ryoko has been responsible for her younger sisters since their parents died. She is popular with the male employees at her company. The player must find a way to make Ryoko stand out and be noticed by male employees, who follow her around the office."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60223"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e4f56b24ebf1da938b452e6871bb55e371847f3f0e9a4be348af065dda6d02e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/299deb825f68e498d7dc198a24623631c242155ef83150ad70a1020ac51ccd25.webp","width":103,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60227","characterName":"駿河 真樹","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60227"},"originalCharacterName":"駿河 真樹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Maki is the middle sister. She is bubbly and full of energy. Maki goes to college with her boyfriend, Ippei Takebayashi and a foreign exchange student, Chamsi \"Cham\" Benenetty. Maki is the top player of the tennis team. The three sisters and their arch-rival, Alice Kagurazaka, are on the tennis team. The storyline progresses through the game as Maki deals with her college life."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60227"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/abe9f31779b97c16b3b5396fa69e52db4c6863e56f1a7d2b8155bd3e68d21af2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8bbe26bb8c4023e0e5b4fdbff7f990657eeefd34d8bb9491a48b7013a3922bee.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60228","characterName":"駿河 未歩","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60228"},"originalCharacterName":"駿河 未歩","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miho is the youngest of the three, complains about looking younger than she is despite being in high school. She is a bookworm and has only one friend at school, her classmate, Kei Satonaka. Miho has a secret crush on another classmate, Yusuke \"Nasshi\" Nashimoto, who is only known about by Kei. The story follows Miho's high school life as turmoil erupts between Miho and Kei over Miho's feelings for Nasshi."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60228"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2b3893615eae7ff0901c3380c321994e9c0f50536e8a5e64ce064925ab910df.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/03ad88d22f6d24d2bd6874bbc8ecd22059465f44621623252034167c3d05afa5.webp","width":98,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60229","characterName":"夏目 轄浩","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60229"},"originalCharacterName":"夏目 轄浩","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"29"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chief of the General Affairs office, Kazuhiro is a capable manager, but has a tendency for a wandering eye when it comes to female employees. He is a charming man with a powerful will. As the story progresses he becomes involved with Ryoko."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60229"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c5a7a3e0d8a4b7c0d65625b8704baea0bf2d90e0f8479f901a6076577a73ecba.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/717e520c876ff91848de4317e22f2baed858ddc9400b7c074f806a17e237d7af.webp","width":132,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60230","characterName":"周防 美咲","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60230"},"originalCharacterName":"周防 美咲","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Best friend of Ryouko's and another office lady at the same branch. She comes from a well-off family and has a pure heart. She tries to do everything she can to help Ryouko, even though she keeps her distance (she does this to keep her from trouble)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60230"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e265cc4ab56f1fba59d1b3d911c786aaa9307da804fd1ad22d6a47ca2355ef12.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/428b761aeee95ccdecd422455ba227b51ffaa3afc202d0dda65c20eeff1aa570.webp","width":94,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60231","characterName":"竹林 一平","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60231"},"originalCharacterName":"竹林 一平","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ippei, known as Ippei-chan by Maki, hangs around with Maki despite him being a male. The relationship is questionable as a boyfriend/girlfriend. Ippei is cheerful and full of energy just like Maki, but he is also very laid back as well. He is a part of the Tennis Club and, according to Maki, could be better than her, but because he does not like it, he ditches the club most of the time. He is also friends with Cham."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60231"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e91f3c0e3a15b76769dc2f1dfc2205118319ff89622c6a7b9e3b4ac1384c9e13.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/99fd312d43e180c34529eb9cbb0ce68635465d22d6251b379e177e8ca82b6d06.webp","width":130,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60232","characterName":"Chamsi Benenetty","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60232"},"originalCharacterName":"Chamsi Benenetty","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Cham is a foreign exchange student from Thailand. Maki and Ippei appear to be her only friends, although Alice seems to tolerate her and even get along with her at times. She is quite clueless and has an unusual sense of taste in food compared to her friends. Because of her cluelessness, Maki feels like a guardian or older sister and tries to protect Cham."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60232"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36563a1f0422e27ef8f5db0c0a259e79c2753ac9596db180c6bcd4d152392660.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a9614f6f6f546802f8c7b9f905ec101663fbd71847b745ed310a66433280009.webp","width":102,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60239","characterName":"里中 螢","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60239"},"originalCharacterName":"里中 螢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kei has a crush on Hashiba-senpai. She is the classmate and best friend of Miho. Kei wants to see romance bloom between Miho and Nasshi and, though the former dislikes it, even tries to force them together at times."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"As the story progresses, she thinks Miho is trying to steal Hashiba-senpai from her and becomes jealous."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60239"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/92918493efa4c5114a499de3091efece1b8614c502e086069db88fb97e312527.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8fcc3b7aedf721ab73cc505a7cdbe78b6edc9b20ab5cedc6f7c47a7cd93d57ee.webp","width":96,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60240","characterName":"梨本 有助","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60240"},"originalCharacterName":"梨本 有助","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yusuke Nashimoto, nicknamed \"Nasshi\" by Kei, is quiet and reserved. He is completely oblivious to Miho's feelings for him. He is classmates with and friends with both Miho and Kei and tries to help them out when they need it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60240"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ced2540cf827b1898d1305d72bc6acb898fa07cd242a6a74783bfc46ca0935f4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74cc751adf61d01082670ca90cb7dee1715c4e5ef903494a90e7ce4057d2e90a.webp","width":123,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60241","characterName":"羽柴せんぱい","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60241"},"originalCharacterName":"羽柴せんぱい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hashiba is a senior in Miho's school and the class heartthrob, and he has a tendency to use women as objects."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"As the game progresses, Miho, Kei and Hashiba get involved in a love triangle, and Kei becomes jealous of Miho."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60241"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c6a4fb24411a58597e134fad7a19b80bc066e3a55965a2b0d748e0b506328e4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5cf5cc0651e5cf397ff86f7c25d4720e90ead4f6c0bd93bc6ad262b6ebfa3ee6.webp","width":125,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p36","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:93","canonicalEntityId":"vnd